<title>UK: Baden-Wuerttemberg L-Finance sets 200 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Baden-Wuerttemberg L-Finance sets 200 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG L-FINANCENV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR L BANK STATE DEVELOPMENT AGENCY OF BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG  AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375 PCT MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.23    PAY DATE   L10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    99.605    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K)1-10-100 SALE LIMITS US/NL/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (1)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT 2001 GILT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
